<http://data.silknow.org/object/fca01e36-da4c-3f42-8cfc-2624394a03c0/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Towel/Napkin, cotton embroidered with silk in double darning and double running in a line.\nThere is a narrow border with a floral meander in which green leaves alternate between red flowers and pink and yellow flowers.  The main border consists of a repeated floral motif with a blue base, a pair of large green leaves, a large pansy-like flowers (either predominantly yellow or predominantly red), two sprigs of buds and two floral sprigs.\nOne side has been cut and hemmed."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/fca01e36-da4c-3f42-8cfc-2624394a03c0> .

